												class="fa fa-times text-danger fa-fw"></i>Reviewed</a>
										<a class="dropdown-item" href="javascript:;"
											onclick="confirmStatusChange({{id}}, 'Feedback')"><i
												class="fa fa-times text-danger fa-fw"></i>Feedback</a>
										<a class="dropdown-item" href="javascript:;"
